      "created_at": "2016-03-18T22:52:19.000Z",
      "cooked": "<p>I used a combo of rebounding debilitator and a Guise combo to abuse the autonomous blades I had on him. Quetzacoatl was likewise discarded by a gimmicky character play or fumbling fool. We happened to get ridof a lot of nemesis by forcing discards with Guise, Setback or Sky-Scraper.</p>",
