      "avatar_template": "/user_avatar/forums.greaterthangames.com/cosmonaut_zero/{size}/2520_2.png",
      "created_at": "2016-04-24T08:31:50.000Z",
      "cooked": "<p>We just beat him tonght, with Greazer, The Operative, and La Capitan. (We were Santa Guise, Omnitronx, Mister Fixer, and Chrono Ranger.)</p><p>We floundered for a couple turns, but a well-timed Grease Gun turned the tide. In my experience job #1 is finding ways to mitigate his damage. Do that, and you've got him.</p>",
